# Every file in this repository is text. Without this, a clone on a machine with
# core.autocrlf enabled rewrites line endings on checkout, so an unrelated
# checkout makes hundreds of files look modified and buries the real diff. That
# happened here: a five-file change presented as sixty-eight.
#
# text=auto still lets Git detect a binary file if one is ever added; eol=lf
# pins the working tree to LF on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
